  "pass_a_gloss": "They have unquenchable light, unceasing motion, and ever-shining rays, which we wish to be illuminated by in our minds, and to escape darkness, the turmoil of life, and the unstable sea of soul-destroying waves.\nof heavens is\nof heavens it is\nof the heavens is\nand of life the salt\nand of life the salt we deviate\nand of the life the salt let us turn away\nthe salt let us turn away...\nthe surge of the soul-destroying waves",
  "pass_b_english": [
    "…of the heavens is, they have unquenchable light, unceasing motion, and ever-shining rays, which we wish to be illuminated by in our minds. And let us escape the darkness, turn away from the salt of life, and, going unsteadily, flee the sea of the surge of soul-destroying waves…"
  ],
  "source_text": "\nοὐρανῶν ἐστιν, τὸ φῶς ἔχουσιν ἄσβεστον, τὸν δρόμον ἀκατάπαυστον, τὰς ἀκτῖνας\nἀειφανεῖς, ἃς ἡμεῖς ἐλλαμφθῆναι ταῖς ἡμετέραις διανοίαις εὐξώμεθα. Καὶ αὐτὸ τὸ\nσκότος ἐκφύγωμεν καὶ τοῦ βίου τὴν ἅλμην ἐκκλίνωμεν καὶ τὴν ἄστατον\nπορευόμενοι θάλασσαν τὸν κλύδωνα τῶν ψυχοφθόρων κυμάτων ἐκφύγωμεν καὶ",
